    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Simon Fraser University and the Aga Khan University on Friday signed an agreement to facilitate joint research, faculty and student exchange and other forms of collaboration between the two institutions aimed at tackling global issues, among them climate change and environmental sustainability.",
